{"id":"word:hebrew:H1823","type":"word","title":"דְּמוּת","subtitle":"H1823 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"resemblance ; concretely, model , shape ; adverbially, like","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to דְּמוּת (H1823) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 25 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"דְּמוּת (dᵉmûwth) means resemblance ; concretely, model , shape ; adverbially, like First listed occurrence: 2Chr 4 3."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"דְּמוּת","transliteration":"dᵉmûwth","pronunciation":"dem-ooth'","strong":"H1823","lemmaId":"hebrew:H1823","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["דְּמ֣וּת","וּ/דְמ֣וּת","דְּמ֖וּת","דְּמ֥וּת","דְּמ֧וּת"],"morphs":[["HNcfsc",9],["HC/Ncfsc",5],["HNcfsa",4],["HR/Ncfsc",3],["HC/Ncfsa",2],["HR/Ncfsc/Sp1cp",1],["HR/Ncfsc/Sp3ms",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"resemblance ; concretely, model , shape ; adverbially, like","usage":"fashion, like (-ness, as), manner, similitude.","full":"H1823. demuth דְּמוּת noun feminine likeness, similitude (mostly late) (according to Lag BN 12. 147 ff. mispunct. for דִּמְוַת from דִּמְוָה ; according to We Prol. 413. Eng. Tr. 389 an Aramaic Loan-word, but see Di Gen 5:1 , Dr JPh xi. 216 Che OP. 474 ) — absolute ׳ד Isa 40:18 3 t.; construct ׳ד Gen 5:1 16 t.; suffix דְּמוּתוֺ 5:3 ; דְּמוּתֵנוּ 1:26 ; &#8212; 1 likeness, similitude , of external appearance, chiefly in Ezek.: Ezek 1:5 ( likeness , i.e. something that appeared like) so 1:26 ; 8:2 (אֵשׁׅ כְּמַרְאֵה דְּמוּת (compare Co), 10:1 ד ׳כְּמַרְאֵה כִּסֵּא ; compare also Dan 10:16 אָדָם בְּנֵי כִּדְמוּת i.e. one like the sons of man; similitude, resemblance Ezek 1:5 , 10 , 16 , 22 , 26 ; 10:10 , 21 , 22 ; אָדָם כְּמַרְאֵה דְּמוּת 1:26 ; י ׳כְּבוֺד ד ׳מַרְאֵה 1:28 ; also 2Kin 16:10 (pattern of altar), 2Chr 4:3 (images of oxen); of son in likeness of father Gen 5:3 (P); so also of man in likeness of God 1:26 (|| צֶלֶם ) 5:1 (both P); compare Isa 40:18 what ׳ד will ye compare to him ( אֵל ) ? || דִּמָּה q. v. 2 adverbially , in likeness of, like as Isa 13:4 compare Ezek 23:15 & ׳כִּד Psa 58:5 . &#8212; Ezek 1:13 read וּבֵינוֺת , see בֵּין and J P Peters JBL 1892 40. 42 . On אֶחָד דְּמוּת 1:16 ; 10:10 (apparently masculine) compare Thes & Sm who translate the likeness of one had they all four ; Co reads אחת .","rootNote":"from 1819 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Chr 4 3","keyReferences":["2Chr 4 3","2Kgs 16 10","Dan 10 16","Ezek 1 5","Ezek 1 5","Ezek 1 10","Ezek 1 13","Ezek 1 16"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":25,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Chr 4 3","book":"2Chr","chapter":4,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/דְמ֣וּת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsc"},{"reference":"2Kgs 16 10","book":"2Kgs","chapter":16,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דְּמ֧וּת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"Dan 10 16","book":"Dan","chapter":10,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כִּ/דְמוּת֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc"},{"reference":"Ezek 1 5","book":"Ezek","chapter":1,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דְּמ֖וּת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"Ezek 1 5","book":"Ezek","chapter":1,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דְּמ֥וּת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"Ezek 1 10","book":"Ezek","chapter":1,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/דְמ֣וּת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsc"},{"reference":"Ezek 1 13","book":"Ezek","chapter":1,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/דְמ֨וּת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsc"},{"reference":"Ezek 1 16","book":"Ezek","chapter":1,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/דְמ֥וּת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"Ezek 1 22","book":"Ezek","chapter":1,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/דְמ֞וּת","source":"h